Third-party documentation vendored under .agents/skills/*/references/
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The Agent Skills in this repository cache the documentation they are built over,
so that they work offline and from a fresh clone. Those cached pages are verbatim
copies of third-party documentation and remain the property of their authors. Each
page carries a generated header naming the URL it came from.

  .agents/skills/kotlin-toolchain/references/
  .agents/skills/compose-multiplatform/references/
      Kotlin Toolchain and Kotlin Multiplatform documentation
      Copyright 2000-2026 JetBrains s.r.o. and contributors
      Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0
      https://kotlin-toolchain.org/ and https://kotlinlang.org/

  .agents/skills/adaptive/references/android/
  .agents/skills/styles/references/android/
      Android developer documentation
      Copyright Google LLC
      Licensed under the Creative Commons Attribution 2.5 license
      https://developer.android.com/

  .agents/skills/ktorfit/references/
      Ktorfit documentation
      Copyright Jens Klingenberg
      Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0
      https://foso.github.io/Ktorfit/

  .agents/skills/material3-compose/references/
      Generated from the resolved Compose Material 3 artifact rather than fetched.
      Describes APIs copyright The Android Open Source Project, Apache License 2.0.

These pages are regenerated, not edited: each skill carries a docs-source.json and
.agents/skills/skill-from-docs/scripts/fetch_docs.py refetches them.
